          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dowiedz się, jak pisać instrukcje warunkowe obsługujące określone warunki, tak jak w poniższym programie.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podczas przesuwania suwaka ten program używa instrukcji warunkowych, aby wyświetlać różne powitania, gdy godzina jest mniejsza niż 7, 12, 17 i 21.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;greetingImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126383447-1baf4fb3c267?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;greeting&quot;&gt;Good Afternoon&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Time: &lt;span id=&quot;hour&quot;&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;:00&lt;/h3&gt; 0:00 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;23&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 23:00 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const time = document.getElementById(&quot;hour&quot;);&#xA;    time.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;greetingImage&quot;);&#xA;    const greeting = document.getElementById(&quot;greeting&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 7) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Rise and shine&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 12) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good morning&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 17) {&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good afternoon&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;,&#xA;      &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 21) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good evening&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     greeting.textContent = &quot;Good night&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Używając instrukcji <code>if</code> i <code>else</code>, możemy napisać program, który wyświetla jedno powitanie, jeśli <code>hour</code> jest mniejsze niż <code>12</code>, a inne, jeśli warunek nie jest spełniony.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hour</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ten program używa jednego powitania przed południem, a innego po południu.</p><p>Umieść <code>hour</code> po lewej stronie. Utwórz warunek, który wyświetli <code>Good morning</code>, gdy wartość jest mniejsza niż <code>12</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hour</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W przypadku bardziej szczegółowego warunku, na przykład gdy <code>hour</code> jest większe niż <code>12</code>, <strong>ale</strong> mniejsze niż <code>17</code>, możemy zamiast tego zapisać <code>elif hour &lt; 17:</code>.</p><p><code>elif</code> oznacza else if. <code>elif</code> używa się, gdy istnieje drugi warunek do sprawdzenia, jeśli warunek bloku <code>if</code> nie został spełniony.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>elif</code>, następnie <code>hour &lt; 17</code> i na końcu <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>elif</code> oznacza <em>else if</em>: drugi warunek sprawdzany, gdy warunek instrukcji <code>if</code> był fałszywy.</p><p>Warunek dotyczący poranka nie został spełniony. Dodaj gałąź tak, aby w konsoli pojawił się komunikat <code>Good afternoon</code>, gdy <code>hour</code> jest mniejsze niż <code>17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 12\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>elif</code>, następnie <code>hour &lt; 17</code> i na końcu <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Instrukcja elif</strong> wykonuje swój blok kodu, jeśli wcześniejsze warunki miały wartość <code>False</code>, a jej warunek, taki jak <code>hour &lt; 17</code>, ma wartość <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>hour &lt; 17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else statement",
            "id": 78162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy zaprogramować instrukcję <code>else</code>, aby wykonała swój blok kodu, gdy warunki <code>if</code> i <code>elif</code> mają wartość <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeśli umieścimy je przed instrukcją <code>else</code>, możemy dodać dowolną liczbę instrukcji <code>elif</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>elif</code>, a następnie <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przed końcowym <code>else</code> możesz dodać dowolną liczbę gałęzi <code>elif</code>.</p><p>Uzupełnij dwie środkowe gałęzie tak, aby dla wartości <code>hour</code> równej <code>20</code> konsola wyświetliła <code>Good evening</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>elif</code>, a następnie <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Less than ten</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Less than five</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Less than ten</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego ten kod wyświetla <code>Less than ten</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Warunek <code>number &lt; 5</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>, a następnie warunek <code>number &lt; 10</code> ma wartość <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Oba warunki mają wartość <code>True</code>, ale blok <code>elif</code> zastępuje wynik bloku <code>if</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python pomija warunek <code>if</code>, gdy występuje po nim instrukcja <code>elif</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Warunek <code>number &lt; 5</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>, a następnie warunek <code>number &lt; 10</code> ma wartość <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: elif keyword",
            "id": 78160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You passed</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>You got an A!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You passed</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego ten kod wyświetla <code>You passed</code> zamiast <code>You got an A!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Warunek <code>score &gt;= 90</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>, ale <code>score &gt;= 70</code> ma wartość <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Oba warunki mają wartość <code>True</code>, więc Python wykonuje tylko blok <code>elif</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok <code>elif</code> jest wykonywany, zanim Python sprawdzi warunek <code>if</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Warunek <code>score &gt;= 90</code> ma wartość <code>False</code>, ale <code>score &gt;= 70</code> ma wartość <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
