            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co się dzieje, gdy warunek instrukcji <code>if</code> i warunki instrukcji <code>elif</code> zwracają wartość <code>False</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kodu instrukcji <code>else</code> zostaje wykonany</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nic się nie dzieje</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kodu instrukcji <code>else</code> zostaje wykonany.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Blok <code>else</code> jest wykonywany, gdy warunki instrukcji <code>if</code> i <code>elif</code> mają wartość <code>False</code>.</p><p>Poniższy wynik dotyczy wartości <code>score = 66</code>. Który blok zostałby wykonany, gdyby <code>score</code> miało wartość <code>80</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"66\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You get an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Better luck next time!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Better luck next time!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok <code>elif</code> wyświetli <code>You passed!</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Blok <code>if</code> wyświetli <code>You get an A!</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok <code>else</code> wyświetli <code>Better luck next time!</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok <code>elif</code> wyświetli <code>You passed!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
